
# What are the odds that you flip 50 coins and get at least 40 heads?

# If you increase the number of flips above 80 or so, the graph-builder and website graph-displayer may struggle to render it in reasonable time.
# However, the numeric solver will have no issues giving you a result, even up to 200 flips.


sum = 0
for i from 1 to 50
	sum = sum + select(0,1)




if sum >= 40
	pass
else
	fail